<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-North sets US$550 mln bank facilities.</title>
<headline>RTRS-North sets US$550 mln bank facilities.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metals and timber group North Ltd said on Wednesday it had signed a series of revolving bank facilities worth a total of US$550 million with 10 Australian and international banks.</p>
</text>
